WEBVTT

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.680
<i>It's the town...</i>

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.280
<i>There's nowhere for me to go.</i>

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:02.000
Yes, I'm very sorry...

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.650
I apologize for all the trouble.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.130
Yes, we'll be there! We'll be right there...

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.170
I'm sorry.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.470
Is this about Takao?

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.010
We have to go to the police station.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:30.440
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:30.440
<b>Episode 11 of 13</b>

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.890
Saeki-san...

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.730
I'm sorry for everything.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:18.070
Nakamura-san...

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.970
<i>Summer...</i>

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.540
<i>It's summer now.</i>

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:07.700
<i>The season of heat that 
makes it impossible to think,</i>

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.370
<i>sunlight hot enough to scorch shadows,</i>

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:16.720
<i>and wild, rustling weeds is here.</i>

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:18.710
Next.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.110
<i>Takao!</i>

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.600
<i>Takao!</i>

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:31.020
<i>Don't just stand there! 
Say something!</i>

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:37.180
<i>I just... can't...</i>

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.480
<i>Takao,</i>

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:46.580
<i>can you explain why you did this?</i>

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.740
<i>It's our fault...</i>

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:58.350
<i>We didn't raise him right!</i>

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.780
<i>Takao, look at me.</i>

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.340
<i>Your mother's crying.</i>

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:18.690
<i>You shouldn't ever do anything 
to make your mother cry.</i>

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:27.410
<i>Tomorrow, your mother and 
I are going to go apologize</i>

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.790
<i>to the parents of Saeki-san and Nakamura-san.</i>

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:34.380
<i>Do you understand how 
serious your actions were?</i>

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:40.980
<i>Reflect on what you've done, okay?</i>

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:02.280
<i>A month has passed...</i>

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.970
<i>Wait up...</i>

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.210
Next.

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:37.030
Dude, Saeki actually has pretty big tits.

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.280
Watch it, Kasuga's around.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.980
Next.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.770
Why? Because he's her boyfriend?

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:52.020
No, I heard they broke up.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:52.730
For real?

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.590
Haven't you noticed how gloomy he's been?

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.690
Yeah, his eyes are totally lifeless.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.690
You don't want to set him off.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.050
Hey, you!

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.410
Nakamura!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.730
You're blocking the lane! 
Stop floating there!

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:18.900
Nakamura, move it.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:19.730
Get over here!

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:32.530
Look, you need to...

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.830
Quit your squawking, birdbrain.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.360
She just walked out.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:55.930
Birdbrain...

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.160
She's been getting worse.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.480
Yeah, she's really becoming a problem.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:19.270
<i>I'm not worthy of being called a pervert.</i>

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:21.460
<i>I am an empty person.</i>

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.030
Kasuga!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.600
Kasuga, wait up!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:41.780
Kasuga...

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:42.440
Ai-chan...

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.850
What's your problem?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.550
I've had enough...

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.160
I don't know what happened,

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.760
but you've ignored Nanako for an entire month.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.520
What are you trying to do?!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.740
You're Kasuga, aren't you?!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:56.960
Ai-chan, it's okay—

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:57.960
It isn't okay!

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:01.180
A month ago, Nanako had 
a horrible experience...

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.860
She got lost, and the cops had to look for her.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:08.150
You realize there's a pervert loose in town?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.620
But you left her all alone?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.040
If you have something to tell her, spill it!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.920
Saeki-san...

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:27.650
I'm sorry about everything.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.060
I'm sure you'll find someone

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.490
who's better for you.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.710
I understand.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.350
Thank you for everything.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.530
Let's break up.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.400
Goodbye.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.530
Huh? Wait, Nanako?

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.130
Nanako!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.060
You're despicable.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.300
Takao, eat your dinner.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.140
I'm sorry.

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:23.120
I'm just not that hungry today.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.650
I'm sorry

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.870
for not eating the food you prepared.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.960
I'm sorry.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.900
I don't feel well,

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:49.000
so I'm going to go lie down in my room.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:53.730
I'm very sorry.

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.830
Please excuse me.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:25.570
<i>I did the right thing...</i>

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:33.260
<i>All that's left for me</i>

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:39.750
<i>is to rot away alone here, in this town.</i>

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:44.010
<i>With nowhere else to go.</i>

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:59.050
Nakamura-san...

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:18.580
Kasuga-kun,

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.650
I trusted you...

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:26.940
I believed you would drop your mask,

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:30.170
and follow me to the other side.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:45.200
Liar.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:04.750
Nakamura-san!

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:07.970
Nakamura-san!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:51.950
<i>Nakamura-san...</i>

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.130
<i>Nakamura-san was mad at me because...</i>

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.730
<i>I get it now.</i>

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:01.900
<i>Nakamura-san was hurt!</i>

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:13.080
<i>Saeki-san doesn't need me to lead a happy life!</i>

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.160
<i>But how is Nakamura-san</i>

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:21.970
<i>supposed to live all alone?</i>

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:27.560
<i>Nakamura-san has it much harder than I do...</i>

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.870
<i>But she was still willing...</i>

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:32.970
<i>to trust an empty person like me!</i>

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.170
<i>I will write an essay!</i>

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:42.280
<i>I won't let Nakamura-san be alone!</i>

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:25.010
Nakamura-san, I'm sorry.

00:23:22.470 --> 00:23:25.010
You never read much anymore.

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:29.240
I... I wrote an essay...

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.520
Aren't you and Kasuga friends?

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:30.910
I just don't get that guy!

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:32.510
Honestly, I'm not sure...

00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:32.400
Talk about creepy!

00:23:32.900 --> 00:23:36.010
I'll do my best to be a real pervert!

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>I wonder why this self-portrait 
is being used so much... 
